    },
    "body": "Thank you very much for getting this moving.  \r\n\r\nNot an exhaustive review yet, and definitely not authoritative, but I wonder if this would need some *deeper* definition.  \r\nFor instance we could hook into the [fill](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#fill-steps) and [stroke](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#stroke-steps) steps. This might be the occasion to finally define the `fill` algorithm that they both do call (see #8145). But maybe this could be handled in a follow-up PR if that's too much work.\r\n\r\nAnother thing that might require discussion: it's relatively unclear if this should affect `clip()` or not.\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/canvas ",
